### DAILY PUZZLE ENDPOINTS
### The puzzle changes every day, so the solution isn't known in advance.

### Get today's puzzle (expect 200 - the solution is never included)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

> {%
    client.test("Puzzle returned without solution", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 but got " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.fen, "Expected a FEN");
        client.assert(response.body.solution === undefined, "The solution must never be sent");
    });
%}

### Get today's puzzle again - second call is served from the database, so it's much faster
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### Get today's puzzle without a token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily

> {%
    client.test("Puzzle needs a token", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 401, "Expected 401 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### Play a move from an empty square (expect 400 "No piece on selected square")
### e4 is empty in almost every puzzle position - change it if today's puzzle has a piece there
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "e4", "to": "e5" }

### Play a move with a square that doesn't exist (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "z9", "to": "e5" }

> {%
    client.test("Invalid square is rejected", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Expected 400 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### Play a move without "from" (expect 400 "From position is required")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "e5" }

> {%
    client.test("Missing from is rejected", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Expected 400 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### Play a real move - REPLACE from/to with a legal move from today's puzzle
### A correct move returns the opponent's reply in "opponentMove";
### a legal but wrong move returns correct=false and costs one of the 10 tries.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily/moves
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "e2", "to": "e4" }

### Play a move without a token (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/puzzles/daily/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "e2", "to": "e4" }

